Z||000000||firstfiero||07-09-2001||10:46 PM||||[IMG] <A HREF="http://www.ProgramFiles\Sony\PictureGear4.1Lite\Samples\sixflags2000\Dsc00006" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ProgramFiles\Sony\PictureGear4.1Lite\Samples\sixflags2000\Dsc00006</A> <BR>[/IMG]<P>Hope this works. It was taking at six flags washington. It's supermans ride of steel. 200 foot drop at 80mph. What's the best coaster you guys road.<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">              <BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif">      <P>[This message has been edited by firstfiero (edited 07-09-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by firstfiero (edited 07-09-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by firstfiero (edited 07-09-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by firstfiero (edited 07-09-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by firstfiero (edited 07-09-2001).]||||reg||7
